# Files that are generated or machine-maintained and must not be reformatted.
#
# Prettier output on a generated file is noise: the next `drizzle-kit generate`
# rewrites it in drizzle's own format, so the diff is a formatting fight that
# never ends. The repo has no `format:check` gate yet (the git-hooks quality
# gate plan covers that), so this list is what keeps `pnpm format` honest.

# Drizzle migration snapshots and the migration journal — written by
# `drizzle-kit generate`, read by `drizzle-kit check` and `drizzle-kit migrate`.
apps/api/drizzle/meta/

# Build output and caches.
dist/
coverage/
node_modules/

# Lockfiles are generated and must stay byte-identical.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Local environment files — never commit, never format.
.env
.env.*
